        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Week 3 - 帮宝宝分辨昼夜</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    background: #fff;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .card {\n    width: 550px;\n    border: 3px solid #f2b632;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    position: relative;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 45%;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-30deg);\n    font-size: 30px;\n    color: rgba(200,200,200,0.35);\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    z-index: 1;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n  td, th {\n    border: 1px solid #f2b632;\n    padding: 10px 14px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333;\n    vertical-align: top;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .label-cell {\n    background: #f2b632;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: center;\n    width: 110px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .center-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  .sub-block {\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .sub-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  ol, ul {\n    margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n  }\n  li {\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .note-cell p {\n    margin: 6px 0;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  u {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <div class=\"watermark\">MOM POWER</div>\n\n  <table>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"label-cell\">周龄</td>\n      <td class=\"center-title\">Week 3</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"label-cell\">新目标</td>\n      <td class=\"center-title\">帮宝宝分辨昼夜</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"label-cell\">怎么做</td>\n      <td>\n        <div class=\"sub-block\">\n          <div class=\"sub-title\">在白天：</div>\n          <ol>\n            <li>当宝宝醒着的时候，开灯、开窗，保持光线明亮</li>\n            <li>宝宝吃奶后，保持TA清醒一会儿，做一些亲子活动比如唱歌说话、俯卧训练</li>\n            <li>喂食间隔不要超过3个小时。如果有必要，叫醒他</li>\n            <li>白天一次清醒时长30~60分钟，包括喂奶时间在内</li>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sub-block\" style=\"border-top:1px solid #f2b632; padding-top:6px;\">\n          <div class=\"sub-title\">在晚上：</div>\n          <ol>\n            <li><u>继续停顿</u>，如果在停顿之后，确定宝宝需要喂奶或换尿布，不要和TA玩，也不要和TA说太多话</li>\n            <li>晚上喂奶前换好尿布，可以用吸水量大一些的夜用尿不湿</li>\n            <li>尽可能把宝宝裹起来（襁褓及睡袋介绍见之前笔记）</li>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"label-cell\">昼夜模式区分清晰</td>\n      <td>\n        总之，充分区分白天和黑夜的环境和活动模式的不同，尽可能把长时间的睡眠留到晚上。\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"label-cell\">注意事项</td>\n      <td class=\"note-cell\">\n        <p>1.在这个周龄，不要太担心养成不好的睡觉习惯。宝宝在你怀里或身上小睡一会儿是完全没问题的。不用强调作息时间，跟着宝宝的自然节奏就行了。</p>\n        <p>3.夜晚不走吃、玩、睡的周期，除了换尿布和喂奶之外，不需要清醒时间</p>\n        <p>4.只要宝宝健康，体重正常增长，不需要在<u>晚上</u>叫醒宝宝喂奶。尽可能让他自己醒来</p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
